    "ranking_note": "Presentation ranking may use recent cellular blood component exposure, timing during or soon after transfusion, fever or measured temperature rise, chills or rigors, headache, nausea, malaise, preserved oxygenation, lack of shock when directly observed, and recurrence with cellular components. Final blood bank adjudication, HLA/leukocyte antibody matching, negative hemolysis or bacterial culture workup, negative TRALI/TACO workup, and dechallenge after stopping the transfusion should stay confirmatory/non-ranking unless testing a post-workup mode."
